ass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>。模型类在同一语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的 ZFC 元语言中比较；链须非空。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreservedTheory}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)=\\mathrm{Mod}(U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreservedTheory}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)=\\mathrm{Mod}(U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Theorem 3.2.3；已阅读 DjVu 165–167 的陈述与交替链证明。正向构造使用紧致性，把目标结构夹入交替的子结构链，使一侧各阶段与原理论模型初等等价，另一侧构成初等链。两条链同并；理论的链闭性使并满足理论，初等链定理把真值送回目标结构，再用 Lemma 3.2.1 得到全称存在公理集。反向中任意有限全称参数在某阶段出现，存在见证也可在该阶段选出，无量词真值沿子结构链保持。不一致理论用全称存在矛盾句处理。已有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7aab232bf2bcb2df\" href=\"?note=7aab232bf2bcb2df\" title=\"17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation\">17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation</a> 是单句版本，本节点记录原书的理论层结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"2024ee60951aa39e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targ